.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trellis-publish 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis\-publish \- Publish packages to Hex, in dependency order, with path deps rewritten
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis publish\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-all\-untagged\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-update\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPACKAGE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Publish packages to Hex, in dependency order, with path deps rewritten
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Resolve a pushed tag (e.g. lat_core\-v1.2.0) to its package
.TP
\fB\-\-all\-untagged\fR
Every releasable package whose version isn\*(Aqt on Hex yet
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
When to color output. `auto` follows the terminal, `NO_COLOR`, and `CLICOLOR=0`; the other two override that detection
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would be published (and rewritten) without doing it
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress the per\-package output stream and the summary table
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Trace every command trellis shells out to, on stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-update\-check\fR
Don\*(Aqt check whether a newer trellis release is available

The check is also skipped in CI, when not attached to a terminal, and when `TRELLIS_NO_UPDATE_CHECK` or `DO_NOT_TRACK` is set.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fIPACKAGE\fR]
A single package to publish
